<!-- Maze for Kyon: lio_mapping mapping and a navigation testbench. Floor at z 0; the robot starts
     in cell (0, 0) at the origin facing +x (kyon_navigation world "maze"). 6 x 6 cells of 4 m
     (3.8 m corridors), walls 1.5-2.5 m high with clutter along them (FAST-LIO needs features along
     corridors), 6 loops and 2 dead ends. The north-east hall has 0.4 m blocks and a tall box
     (obstacles), a 0.2 m ramp to a platform and 2 x 0.1 m steps down (traversable); a 5 cm curb
     crosses the corridor between cells (1, 1) and (1, 2). Layout (north up, cell (i, j) at (4 i, 4 j)):
       #############
       #     #     #
       # # # #     #
       # #   #     #
       # ##### #   #
       #       #   #
       ### ### ### #
       #   #     # #
       # # # ### # #
       # #   #   # #
       # ##### # # #
       #     #   # #
       #############
-->
